      ],
      "en": "After the death of Joshua, the children of Israel asked of the LORD, saying, “Who should go up for us first against the Canaanites, to fight against them?”",
      "ko": "여호수아가 죽은 후에 이스라엘 자손이 여호와께 묻자와 가로되 우리 중 누가 먼저 올라가서 가나안 사람과 싸우리이까",
      "source_text_hash": "9826846cd1ea1b3e0d45e2af09ff8244cdaef9c22134d29ae24d7c66f6936212",
      "translation_text_hash": "d5295f7df2dcd95b3854a4e64aa37d2a919784f38c1eb6fa00c000c338435111",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
