      "en": "The children of Judah fought against Jerusalem, took it, struck it with the edge of the sword, and set the city on fire.",
      "ko": "유다 자손이 예루살렘을 쳐서 취하여 칼날로 치고 성을 불살랐으며",
      "source_text_hash": "b2152f7db3b436819a086e83374e892e6720e127db51e8a793c1929eb59c1fc2",
      "translation_text_hash": "8f072d8394e696b6548ea1c4dbd78e6320f1ff5aa040d1d3c155dea75b020ce6",
