      "en": "After that, the children of Judah went down to fight against the Canaanites who lived in the hill country, and in the South, and in the lowland.",
      "ko": "그 후에 유다 자손이 내려가서 산지와 남방과 평지에 거한 가나안 사람과 싸웠고",
      "source_text_hash": "27721cf48fcc0f565ade88528ebf185b1f67e54240e02edcbe01ae55034b1c71",
      "translation_text_hash": "629de53ce8fd5c2e18b5a5844c4154275c1c7adaa2e101cabb3ffaa40e1ed99d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
