      "en": "Othniel the son of Kenaz, Caleb’s younger brother, took it, so he gave him Achsah his daughter as his wife.",
      "ko": "갈렙의 아우요 그나스의 아들인 옷니엘이 그것을 취한고로 갈렙이 그 딸 악사를 그에게 아내로 주었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "997547311b59b52fd57a355e47c3459a6bd9285574ec08489ccbf83df50ba2b4",
      "translation_text_hash": "2d2b56acc26a6cfbb7a063a8a9100d7c2a411458f3ff52f22ee24ef2f4f10512",
