      "en": "When she came, she got him to ask her father for a field. She got off her donkey; and Caleb said to her, “What would you like?”",
      "ko": "악사가 출가할 때에 그에게 청하여 자기 아비에게 밭을 구하자 하고 나귀에서 내리매 갈렙이 묻되 네가 무엇을 원하느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "6dce6d29cd4453c4f876db6a715722fb55d9064b2a7ccba9860cebf95255abb6",
